1
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,840
孩子们起床了
Come on, boys!

2
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,320
今儿个可是闰日 不是困日
It's leap day, not sleep day!

3
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,360
我超爱闰日
I love leap day!

4
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,680
算是邓菲家的重大节日吧
It's kind of a big deal in the Dunphy house.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,260
今年我们甚至把曼尼都拉进来了
This year, we even got Manny involved.

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,960
老天赐予你多出来的24小时
You're given this gift of 24 extra hours.

7
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,800
可不能浪费在工作或学习上
You can't waste it at work or school.

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,520
得用来做些非同寻常的事
You have to do something extraordinary,

9
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,760
令人震惊的事
something shocking.

10
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:28,140
今年 我们全家要去学习玩"空中飞人"
This year, the entire family is taking a trapeze class.

11
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,380
非同寻常吧
How extraordinary is that?

12
00:00:29,386 --> 00:00:29,980
那可是我的主意
It was my idea.

13
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,560
震惊吧
How shocking is that?

14
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,720
每隔四年我都会心血来潮一次
I can be spontaneous every four years.

15
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,760
我都等不及了
I can't wait.

16
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,620
闰日什么的傻爆了
Leap day is stupid.

17
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,840
你没有理解其背后的因果关系
You're not understanding the logic behind it.

18
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:42,940
一年实际上有365.25天
A year is actually 365.25 days.

19
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,220
所以每隔四年 就会多出一天
Every four years, we gain one day.

20
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,720
如果不靠闰日来调整的话 大约40年后
If we didn't adjust the calendar in, say, 40 years,

21
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:50,260
二月就变成一月了
February would almost be January.

22
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:54,520
关我屁事 关你屁事
That's not my problem, and it's definitely not your problem.

23
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,140
看看
Look at this.

24
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,680
家政又把我的白衣服染成粉红了
The housekeeper turned another one of my whites pink.

25
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,980
我不能穿着这个去运动酒吧
I can't wear this to a sports bar.

26
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:02,060
群众的目光又不会在你身上 杰
Mm, they're not going to be looking at you, Jay.

27
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,820
某人自我感觉相当良好哦
Somebody's feeling pretty good about herself.

28
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:05,500
他们关注的是比赛
They're going to be watching the match.

29
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,840
你还是暗指了一下自己吧
You meant you a little bit.

30
00:01:09,467 --> 00:01:10,726
好 插在这里
Okay, put it in there.

31
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,220
好了 悄悄的哦
All right, very quietly,

32
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:15,602
我们要去二爸的卧室 打开门
we're gonna go to daddy's bedroom, open the door,

33
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,960
祝我生日快乐
Happy birthday to me.

34
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:21,640
-我满10岁了 -是40岁
- I'm 10! - 40!

35
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,340
我生在2月29日
I was born February 29th,

36
00:01:24,340 --> 00:01:26,660
至今为止这日子出现过10次
and there have been ten of those... in my lifetime,

37
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,140
所以人家才10岁
therefore I'm 10!

38
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:29,160
太好玩了
It's fun.

39
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:30,940
相当好玩
It's so much fun.

40
00:01:31,114 --> 00:01:33,600
总之 我这四年都在琢磨
Anyway, I-I've spent the last four years

41
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,880
为我家老公办什么样的派对
trying to figure to what kind of party to throw this one.

42
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:37,100
亲爱的 你知道
Oh, honey, you know I'd be fine

43
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:39,060
能和你在家随便过一晚我就很满足了
with just a nice casual evening at home with you.

44
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,579
别 可别这么说
Don't--don't even.

45
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,580
他上次就来这一套
No. No! That's what he said last time.

46
00:01:44,361 --> 00:01:46,850
好 小寿星 要看什么呢
Okay, birthday boy, what's it gonna be--

47
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,120
爱情喜剧片还是恐怖片
Rom com or horror?

48
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,590
或者是兼具这两种风格的《女佣变凤凰》
Or we can do both and watch "Maid in Manhattan."

49
00:01:50,843 --> 00:01:51,979
你干嘛
Whatcha doing?

50
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:52,920
我不要跟你一起养孩子了
Canceling our baby.

51
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:09,700
行 向爸爸问好 拜
Okay, love to dad. Bye! Mwah!

52
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,120
二爸 你在干嘛
Daddy, what are you doing?

53
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,840
是啊 二爸 你干什么呢
Yeah, daddy, what are you doing?

54
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,380
在偷找你生日派对的线索吗
Snooping for hints about your birthday?

55
00:02:19,836 --> 00:02:23,260
不 人家只是太兴奋了 想帮帮忙嘛
No, I'm just excited, and I wanna be helpful.

56
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:24,920
我知道你不擅长策划派对什么的
I know party planning isn't your thing.

57
00:02:26,442 --> 00:02:28,340
你得对我有点信心 小卡
Y-you need to trust me, Cam.

58
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:29,620
我知道 我真的信任你
I know, and I do.

59
00:02:29,717 --> 00:02:31,900
反正你也"不会"弄什么过时的东西
It's not like you're gonna do anything tired,

60
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:33,380
比如苹果马提尼啊 冰雕啊
like appletinis or ice sculptures.

61
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:35,320
或者是合成纤维餐巾 聚酯产品之类
Or synthetic napkins or anything mylar.

62
00:02:35,380 --> 00:02:36,420
够了 小卡
Cam, that's enough!

63
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,600
这四年来我都在为上次的派对赎罪
I've been paying for your last party for four years.

64
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,600
而且你不相信我能
And I find it a little insulting

65
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,380
办好这派对 有点侮辱人呢
that you don't think I can pull this off.

66
00:02:42,380 --> 00:02:43,120
好吧
You know what?

67
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,980
我相信你 我放手不管了
I trust you. I'm letting go.

68
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,320
-好吧 -好吗
- Okay. - Okay?

69
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:49,280
你知道橘色已经不流行了 对吧
You know orange is over, right?

70
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,080
不过是个简单的派对 我干得来
It's a simple party. I can do it.

71
00:02:51,180 --> 00:02:51,500
简单
Simple.

72
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,460
"好"极了
Perfect.

73
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,600
没错 只是一个"简单的"派对
Yeah, just a simple party.

74
00:02:57,020 --> 00:03:00,240
我"简单地"选了小卡最爱的电影《绿野仙踪》
I'm simply taking Cam's favorite movie, "The wizard of Oz,"

75
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,340
把家里变身为绿野仙踪主题嘉年华
and turning our house into an oz-themed extravaganza--

76
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:06,520
黄砖图案的地毯 身着戏装的招待
Yellow brick carpet, waitstaff in full costume,

77
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,982
以及为小卡量身打造的红宝石鞋
and custom-made ruby slippers for Cam.

78
00:03:09,026 --> 00:03:10,630
帅吧
Whazzup?!

79
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,100
那活动安全吗
So is this safe?

80
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,240
不过是个"空中飞人"
It's a trapeze.

81
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:16,317
放轻松 "空中飞人"比被陌生人持刀杀害
Relax. More people are killed by knife-wielding strangers

82
00:03:16,317 --> 00:03:18,047
死得少多了
than from trapezing.

83
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:19,980
我有点想直接回家宅着了
I'm thinking about going home now.

84
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,420
亲爱的 你还好吧
Honey, are you okay?

85
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:28,960
我没事
I'm fine.

86
00:03:29,573 --> 00:03:30,566
我在看
I'm watching...

87
00:03:30,841 --> 00:03:32,320
太催泪了
It's so sad.

88
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:36,640
天啊 可别在今天啊
Oh, no. Not today.

89
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:37,920
怎么了
What's wrong?

90
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,986
没事 你妈只是
Nothing. No, your mom's just, uh...

91
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,340
情绪有点激动而已
feeling emotional.

92
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:44,140
她上个月这时候就这德行 上上个月也是
She was like this last month and the month before

93
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:45,480
上上上个月也是
and the month before.

94
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,460
啥 老娘要杀人了
What?! I could kill someone!

95
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,740
我听不见你说话
No, I can't hear you!

96
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,060
这傻缺电话在这破房子里收不到信号
This stupid phone gets no reception in this stupid house! Aah!

97
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:55,480
苍天啊 不会吧
Dear god, no.

98
00:03:55,789 --> 00:03:57,169
我听过传言
I'd heard rumors.

99
00:03:57,540 --> 00:03:59,140
没错 大家都听说过
Yeah, we all had,

100
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:01,980
女人们在一起工作生活
that females living or working in close quarters

101
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:04,660
最后经期就会变得一致
could eventually get on the same... cycle.

102
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:06,660
不过我一直以为这说法是编来
But I always assumed that was a story designed

103
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:08,340
阻止女性加入潜艇部队的
to keep women out of submarine corps.

104
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,600
这不是牛奶 我今天到底怎么了
This isn't milk. What's wrong with me today?

105
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,120
大脑都不正常运转了
My brain's not working right.

106
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:15,660
不会吧
No.

107
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,560
我没法集中
I can't focus...

108
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:20,080
三条腿
Three legs?

109
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,900
太不公平了
It's not fair.

110
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:22,740
我就说嘛
I know.

111
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:24,341
太催泪了
Oh, no! It's sad.

112
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:27,039
我的天 这下乐子全被她们毁了
Oh, my god. They're gonna ruin everything.

113
00:04:27,039 --> 00:04:30,080
没有的事 咱们多长点心眼就行
No. We--we just need to be extra sensitive.

114
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,400
菲尔 亲爱的 什么时候出发
Phil, honey, when do we need to leave?

115
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:33,580
你准备好就行 亲爱的 20分钟后好吗
Whenever's good for you, sweetie. Maybe 20 minutes?

116
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,043
-20分钟 -给个准话好吗 菲尔
- 20 minutes?! - Then which one is it, Phil?

117
00:04:35,054 --> 00:04:38,560
是等我准备好还是20分钟后
Is it whenever it's good for me or is it 20 minutes?!

118
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,560
你们准备好就行
Whenever you're ready!

119
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:43,360
该来的还是来了 那些年一起来的大姨妈
It happened-- Satan's trifecta.

120
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:46,240
我最恐惧的一天 降临在了我最爱的这一天
The day I most dreaded had fallen on the day I most loved.

121
00:04:50,593 --> 00:04:51,980
她们会毁了这次"空中飞人"
They're gonna ruin trapezing.

122
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:53,440
我打赌她们已经有点错乱了
I bet they don't even catch me.

123
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,680
你这么害怕干嘛 她们都是通情达理的人
Why are you so afraid of them? They're reasonable.

124
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,700
不如建议让她们待在家里
Why don't we just suggest they stay home,

125
00:04:57,709 --> 00:04:59,557
-好好招待大姨... -嘘
- considering they're all on their menst-- - Shh!

126
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,380
对付大姨妈的第一要点是
The first rule of dealing with the cycle--

127
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:03,100
绝口不提那仨字
You never mention the cycle.

128
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:04,560
要旁敲侧击打埋伏
You tiptoe around it.

129
00:05:05,302 --> 00:05:07,400
女人要承受异常的苦痛
The woman's actually taken great pains

130
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:09,440
来压制身体里的魔鬼
to hide the monster she's become.

131
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:12,500
但要是说出真相 那魔鬼拦都拦不住了
But if you acknowledge it, that brings the monster forth.

132
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:13,720
老天
My god.

133
00:05:13,965 --> 00:05:15,760
一来就是三只啊
And there's three of them.

134
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,400
没事的
It's okay.

135
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,600
我有个计划
I have a plan.

136
00:05:19,820 --> 00:05:22,700
通常有人说"我有个计划"时
It's kind of traditional for people to lean in

137
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:24,120
大家就应该前倾围过来的
when somebody says, "I have a plan."

138
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:26,520
好的
Okay...

139
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:31,348
好 好 好 好
Ja! Ja! Ja! Ja!

140
00:05:31,348 --> 00:05:32,620
不要啊
Ooh! No!

141
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:34,880
冲 冲 冲 冲
Si! Si! Si! Si!

142
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,000
进了
Goal!

143
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,040
进了
Goal!

144
00:05:38,053 --> 00:05:41,135
你应该管你们国家叫"荷烂"
You should call your country "The Never-lands"

145
00:05:41,135 --> 00:05:43,880
-因为你们永远不可... -对 因为我们永远不可能赢
- Because you're never-- - Ja, because we are never going to win.

146
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,240
你都说了无数遍了
You said that a billion times.

147
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:46,320
回家洗洗睡吧
Just go home.

148
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,840
你这荷兰佬干嘛不回家洗洗睡
Why don't you Dutch people go home?

149
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:51,180
闭上你的哥伦比亚大嘴巴吧
Someone should shut your Colombian mouth!

150
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:53,581
-有本事试试看 -有什么问题吗
- Okay, I wanna see you try! - Uh, is there a problem over here?

151
00:05:53,630 --> 00:05:56,250
没错 大问题 你娶的就是个大问题
Yes. There is a problem, and you're married to her.

152
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:58,060
是吗 我倒是有个提议
Really? Well, let me make a suggestion.

153
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,580
你好好坐着 我请你喝杯啤酒
Why don't you sit down, I send you over a beer,

154
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:03,200
我和我妻子坐到那边看
my wife and I watch from over there?

155
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,940
这样就皆大欢喜了
That way, everybody enjoys the game--

156
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:07,740
除了我 因为我更喜欢看激烈点的比赛
Except me, 'cause I prefer a game where something happens.

157
00:06:07,821 --> 00:06:08,408
歌洛莉亚 我们走
Gloria, let's go.

158
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:09,280
走吧
Let's go.

159
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:16,140
我还以为你刚刚要揍那家伙呢
I thought you were going to punch that guy back there.

160
00:06:16,140 --> 00:06:18,180
我比那孩子壮60磅呢
Ah, I got 60 pounds on the kid.

161
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:21,800
也对 只是听过很多关于你的英勇事迹
Yeah. It's just that I've heard so many stories about you fighting.

162
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,430
为这点小事没必要的
And-- it's not worth the trouble.

163
00:06:23,578 --> 00:06:26,260
对啊 他那儿还有一大帮朋友
Yeah, and he has all those friends and...

164
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:27,740
跟人多人少没关系
Well, his friends had nothing to do with it.

165
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:29,940
有时候 得饶人处且饶人嘛
I mean, sometimes it's better to take the high road.

166
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,780
当缩头乌龟是挺好的
Yeah, it's better that you walked away.

167
00:06:33,139 --> 00:06:34,400
歌洛莉亚 我感觉你
Gloria, I get-- I get the impression

168
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:36,800
-对我没出手有点失望 -哪有的事
- you're disappointed I didn't punch that guy. - Of course not.

169
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:40,540
谁在乎那些为媳妇不顾一切的爷们气概啊
Who needs all that manly, protect-your-woman stuff?

170
00:06:40,652 --> 00:06:42,593
不是 你看你又这样 嘴上说一套
No, see, like, right there. You're saying one thing,

171
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,220
心里想的完全相反
but it feels like you mean the opposite.

172
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,880
-没有 -那就是有
- No. - That's a "Yes."

173
00:06:46,420 --> 00:06:48,640
听着 杰 我就是来看球赛的
Look, Jay, I just came to watch the game.

174
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,560
-我可不想跟人吵 -我也不想[打架]
- I don't want to fight. - Neither do I.

175
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:52,160
我就知道
I know.

176
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:55,280
为了与电影场景一致
So in keeping with the film,

177
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,940
这部分要变成黑白
this area will be in black and white,

178
00:06:56,940 --> 00:06:59,820
然后这边就是明快的彩色
and then an explosion of technicolor.

179
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:02,500
最棒的部分 宾客一进来
Best part--as the guests are coming in...

180
00:07:02,521 --> 00:07:04,755
埃姆婶婶 埃姆婶婶[片中台词]
Auntie Em! Auntie Em!

181
00:07:05,540 --> 00:07:07,020
模拟龙卷风是也
A simulated tornado.

182
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,651
真好 他一定会爱死的
Yeah. Oh, he's gonna love that.

183
00:07:08,851 --> 00:07:10,860
-苹果马提尼不要了 -没错
- So the appletinis are canceled... - Yes.

184
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:12,320
小狗托托也订好了 还有
The little Toto dog is ordered, and...

185
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:15,000
别告诉我你穿着戏服还捣鼓潘趣酒呢
Please tell me that you are not mixing punch in costume!

186
00:07:17,541 --> 00:07:20,317
不是吧 小卡回家干嘛
Oh, no! W-what is Cam doing home?

187
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:22,500
-你好 -你好
- Hey. - Hey.

188
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:23,300
我们来扮猴子的
We're the monkeys.

189
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:25,480
你们好 请进 快点 快点
Yes, hi. Hi. Come on inside. Quickly, quickly.

190
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,600
你好 等会就来
Hi. Okay, one second.

191
00:07:28,135 --> 00:07:29,920
回来干嘛啊
Hey! Whatcha doing home?

192
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,549
你又不放心我 回来检查派对情况吗
Are you checking on me and the party again?

193
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,200
没有 我把手机落你车里了
No, no. I left my cell phone in your car

194
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,400
一会儿还得跟我妈联系呢
and I gotta be in touch with mama today.

195
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,600
她今天第一次跟保险公司谈
She's talking to the insurance agency for the first time

196
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,960
看看他们能不能重建爷爷的农场
to see if they're gonna rebuild grandpa's farm.

197
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,020
重建
Rebuild the...

198
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:41,560
因为龙卷风
Because of the tornado.

199
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:43,900
我完全忘了这茬
I totally missed the connection.

200
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,100
就在有史以来最具毁灭性的龙卷风
A month after the most devastating twister

201
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,549
席卷小卡家乡一个月后
that ever hit Cam's hometown,

202
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:49,440
我筹备了一个
I throw a party

203
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:52,220
以同志电影中最著名的龙卷风为主题的派对
based on gay cinema's most famous tornado.

204
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,880
是的 都过去一个月了
Yeah, you know, it's been a month,

205
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:58,860
保险方面还没有任何消息 她都快发疯了
and she hasn't heard anything, and she's just beside herself.

206
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:00,120
你知道还有什么很糟糕吗
And then you know what else?

207
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:01,680
莉莉因伤去世了
Lily succumbed to her injuries.

208
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:03,860
-你莉莉姨妈去世了 -没有 是我家的猪
- Your aunt Lily died? - No, the family pig.

209
00:08:03,914 --> 00:08:05,064
莉莉姨妈是头
Aunt Lily was a...

210
00:08:05,205 --> 00:08:06,712
咱闺女是以头猪起名的啊
We named our daughter after a pig?

211
00:08:06,712 --> 00:08:09,640
你能不能看看我的伤痛 暂时别抱怨了
Could you just witness my pain instead of criticizing?

212
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,540
我今天只想跟家人聊聊
I just want to be in touch with my family today.

213
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:14,560
忘掉该死的龙卷风 这样才能享受
Get all this tornado stuff behind me so I can enjoy...

214
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:17,520
你为我准备的超赞派对
the fabulous party you're planning for me!

215
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:19,080
没错 赶紧走吧
Yeah! You gotta get outta here!

216
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:20,760
-好的 听着小卡 -咋了
- Okay. Hey, listen. Hey, Cam? - Yeah?

217
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,960
你就跟家人叙叙吧 帮我问好
You just call your family, tell them I said "Hi."

218
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:25,580
也不用急着六点整准时回来啦
And don't worry about being back at 6:00 on the dot.

219
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:26,700
你可以先缓缓
There's a little breathing room.

220
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,160
什么 没搞错吧
Oh, what, are you kidding me?

221
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,820
派对一嗨起
The sooner I can start to party,

222
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,200
烦恼全忘掉
the sooner I can start to forget.

223
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:32,520
但再说一遍
But then again.

224
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:35,200
如果你逃避跟龙卷风有关的一切
Hey, if you keep running from every reminder of the tornado,

225
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:36,740
那不就败给龙卷风了吗
doesn't the tornado win?

226
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:38,960
米奇尔 我爷爷天天早上去看小货车
Mitchell, my grandpa runs to his pickup truck every morning

227
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:41,140
因为他觉得草耙随时会从天掉回
because he thinks the pitchfork is gonna come back down.

228
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,760
龙卷风是不可战胜的
The tornado always wins.

229
00:08:43,158 --> 00:08:46,162
好了 今晚肯定会非常开心的
Okay, well, it's gonna be so much fun tonight!

230
00:08:46,380 --> 00:08:48,140
我知道 10岁大关
I know! The big 1-0!

231
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:50,420
注意点 米奇尔
Hey, Mitchell!

232
00:08:51,198 --> 00:08:53,094
-我在这儿 -差点撞到你
- I'm over here! - I could've hit you!

233
00:08:53,094 --> 00:08:55,100
但是没撞到 我在跳爱意舞
But you didn't! I'm doing my "I love ya" dance.

234
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:56,980
好的 我在开爱意车
Okay, I'm doing my "I love you" car dance.

235
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,300
瞧你
Look at you!

236
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:00,800
别这样 好了 回去吧
Stop that! Okay! Go!

237
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:01,960
太危险了
This is dangerous.

238
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,800
-我不跳了 -回去吧
- Okay, okay. - Go.

239
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,480
你快开车吧
Get out of here, you.

240
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,700
今天我过生日啦
It's my birthday!

241
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:09,680
好了各位 过来 咱们得谈谈
All right, guys, come here. We need to talk.

242
00:09:13,260 --> 00:09:15,020
-终于来了 -别催我们
- There they are. - Stop rushing us!

243
00:09:15,620 --> 00:09:16,780
小家伙 怎么了
Buddy, what's wrong?

244
00:09:17,180 --> 00:09:19,740
是啊 你整个早上都不在状态
Yes, you've been a little off all morning.

245
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,980
最近我感到特有压力
I've been feeling a lot of stress lately.

246
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:24,440
脑袋昏沉沉的 而且有些情绪化
My head's all foggy, and I'm kind of emotional.

247
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:26,740
希望你能很快好起来
Oh. Well, I sure hope you feel better soon

248
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,980
玩"空中飞人"时 头脑要相当的清醒
'cause you really need your wits about you when you're trapezing.

249
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:32,600
真奇怪 因为我们三个
This is weird because the three of us

250
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,100
今天也感觉非常不舒服
haven't exactly been feeling our best today either.

251
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:36,020
真的吗
Really?

252
00:09:36,020 --> 00:09:37,240
我找不到另一只袜子了
I can't find my other sock!

253
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,948
看看是不是穿一只脚上了
Try looking under the one you have one.

254
00:09:38,948 --> 00:09:41,598
我不是你 不会这么蠢 看到没
I am not you. I don't do that. See?

255
00:09:42,855 --> 00:09:44,082
天啊 我和你一样蠢
Oh, god, I am you.

256
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:47,620
我们不去玩"空中飞人"了 你不介意吧
Would you mind if we sat out trapezing?

257
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:48,600
-是吗 -是啊
- Really? - Yeah.

258
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,660
你确定吗 好的
Are you sure? Okay.

259
00:09:50,180 --> 00:09:51,360
他为什么要这个样子
Why does he do that?

260
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:52,360
每月如此
Every month.

261
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:54,580
没错 我是有点喜怒无常
Yeah, I get a little moody,

262
00:09:54,580 --> 00:09:56,460
但身体不适的烦躁
but unrelentin physical discomfort

263
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:57,720
就会让人这样
will do that to a person.

264
00:09:58,340 --> 00:09:59,480
他知不知道
Doesn't he know

265
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,600
他越是旁敲侧击 当我们疯子一样
that tiptoeing around someone like they're crazy

266
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,760
越是令我们抓狂
makes them crazy?

267
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,500
好的 你跟曼尼去吧
All right, you and Manny go ahead.

268
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:06,360
-卢克不舒服就留下来 -等等 什么情况
- Luke can just stay here with us. - Wait. What?

269
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:08,140
其实卢克看起来已经好多了
Luke's actually looking better.

270
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,380
-我好些了 -还是稳妥点好
- I am better. - Well, let's not take any chances.

271
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:13,780
-他在家休息 你们去吧 -爸
- He can stay here. You go ahead. - Dad?

272
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:14,220
爸爸
Daddy?

273
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:15,660
回见了 小家伙
See you later, buddy.

274
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:17,560
我们怎么办
What are we going to do?

275
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:18,880
不能让任何一个兄弟掉队
We leave no man behind.

276
00:10:19,019 --> 00:10:20,551
我看我还是回家吧
I think I'm just gonna go home.

277
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,800
还有时间
We have time.

278
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:26,200
撤掉这些布置 办一场普通派对
Just take down the decorations and have a normal party.

279
00:10:26,210 --> 00:10:27,800
在自家办场闷死人派对
Yeah, and throw a boring party in our house

280
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:29,640
一看就知道是今天下午仓促准备的
that looks like I just threw it together this afternoon?

281
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,480
-动脑子 -有其它选择
- Think! - Okay, we have a few options.

282
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:33,580
我可以在"阿米莉亚"餐厅给你弄到包间
I can get you the back room at Amelia's.

283
00:10:33,590 --> 00:10:34,920
曾经把果汁洒在老板家白色地毯上
Spilled juice on the owner's white rug

284
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,260
还差点害死她的小孩 再想
and almost killed her toddler. Next.

285
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:37,040
保龄球场
Bowling alley?

286
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,560
不够有档次 你有什么想法
Not classy enough. What have you got?

287
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:39,740
真没用 你说
You're no help. You.

288
00:10:40,220 --> 00:10:41,940
上周末 我去船上参加了派对
Well, last weekend, I did a party on a boat.

289
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:44,000
你说你去看望爸妈了
You said you were visiting your parents.

290
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,960
我需要离开你透透气
You're suffocating me.

291
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,480
什么样的船 说清楚点
What's this boat? Tell me about the boat.

292
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:49,160
我们在豪华游艇上举办了一场别致晚宴
Okay, we did an elegant dinner party on a luxury yacht

293
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:50,120
参加人数大约25个
for about 25 people.

294
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:52,460
可以在海湾转转 在月光下起舞
It takes you around the harbor, dancing under the moonlight.

295
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:55,498
好的好的 也许可以想个主题
Okay, okay. Uh, maybe we can-- we can make a theme out of this.

296
00:10:55,498 --> 00:10:57,579
小卡的人生就是一次远航
You know, Cam's life is like a long voyage.

297
00:10:57,579 --> 00:11:00,700
有时波涛汹涌 但永远一往直前
Sometimes choppy but--but always forward, ever forward.

298
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:02,420
-只有两小时 -快订吧
- We have two hours. - Book it.

299
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:06,820
你居然挺过了"空中飞人"
Hey, you survived trapeze class, huh?

300
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,640
没去成
Didn't happen,

301
00:11:07,820 --> 00:11:10,080
本着基本的做人道理 我还是不说原因了
and common decency prevents me from telling you why.

302
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:11,840
足球比赛怎么样
How was the soccer match?

303
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,723
激动人心 一比一打平
Thrilling. 1-1 tie.

304
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,240
有个进球是个意外
One of the goals was an accident.

305
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,800
你去了我妈肯定很开心
I'm sure my mom was happy you went.

306
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,480
我不知道她今天是怎么了
I don't know what to make of her today.

307
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,760
她和一个家伙杠上了
She got into it with this guy,

308
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,980
我肯定她有意怂恿我和那家伙打一架
and I swear she was pushing me into a fight with him.

309
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:23,840
她现在喜欢暴力吗
Now is that something she'd want?

310
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,740
我不知道
I don't know.

311
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:27,260
我一直以为女人进化得比男人成熟
I always thought of women as the more evolved sex.

312
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:29,820
但是今天 我才真是大开眼界 杰
But after today... I've seen things, Jay.

313
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,740
我年轻时可不是省油的灯
'Cause, you know, I had my share of fights in my time.

314
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,734
知道不
You know that.

315
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,340
太烫了
It's too warm for me.

316
00:11:36,638 --> 00:11:38,920
我记得有一次 我和迪迪过马路
Yeah, I remember this time I was crossing the street with Dede,

317
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,680
有个混蛋差点开车撞到她
and some jackass almost clipped her.

318
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:43,540
我把他揍到地上 脚踩在他脖子上后
I had the guy on the ground, my foot on his neck,

319
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:44,800
他的车才停下来
before the car stopped moving.

320
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,920
你的光荣历史大家都听过
Yeah, we've heard all those stories.

321
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:49,020
也许一睹真汉子杰的风采 才是我妈的期望
Maybe my mom wouldn't mind a glimpse of that Jay.

322
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:51,120
是我妈
That's her.

323
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,920
她要我帮忙去给小卡挑礼物
She wants me to help pick out Cam's gift.

324
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,380
我还是原来的真汉子 百分百纯爷们儿
I'm still that guy, you know. 100%.

325
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:57,700
见鬼 怎么弄个饼干都把手划破了
What the hell? How do you cut your finger on a cracker?

326
00:11:58,020 --> 00:11:59,740
总之 如果我认为值得一战
Anyway, if I thought there was a fight worth fighting,

327
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,580
我绝对会挺身一战
I'd fight it.

328
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:03,020
盐进伤口了 痛死了
Ow! Now I got salt in this. That stings!

329
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:10,700
下次 别冲你老板大喊大叫
Next time, don't scream at your boss

330
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:12,600
这样他就不会让你周末工作了
so that he doesn't make you work during the weekends.

331
00:12:15,494 --> 00:12:16,746
好了 再见
Si. Adios.

332
00:12:17,916 --> 00:12:19,640
妈 你在骂谁呢
Hey, mom. Who were you yelling at?

333
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,060
你老爸 宝贝
Your father, baby.

334
00:12:21,060 --> 00:12:23,180
他这周末没空
He cannot make it this weekend.

335
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,060
好吧 我承认
Okay, I admit it.

336
00:12:28,070 --> 00:12:31,948
我希望杰在酒吧里猛揍那个荷兰佬一顿
I wanted Jay to kick that little dutch man's ass at the bar.

337
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:34,280
可在电话里和哈维尔讲了几句后
But two seconds on the phone with Javier,

338
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:38,680
我意识到了冲动鲁莽的下场
and I remember what that stupid hothead behavior gets you-

339
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,360
没有好下场
Nothing.

340
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:42,000
像杰这样冷静其实更好
It's better to be calm like Jay.

341
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:46,100
像杰和我那样冷静 好吧 我自觉排除在外
Like Jay and me. Like Jay.

342
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,340
我回来了
I'm back!

343
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:52,520
谁会想到 我把帅呆了的太阳眼镜给忘了
Wouldn't you know, I forgot my ding-dang sunglasses.

344
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,560
卢克 来给我搭把手行吗
Luke, could you give me a hand?

345
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:59,720
从来不奢望菲尔会回来 为他搞的那些花样
What were the chances that Phil had come back to apologize

346
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,900
向我道歉
for all the game playing

347
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:03,180
然后跟我开诚布公地
and have an open conversation with me

348
00:13:03,180 --> 00:13:04,420
谈谈我的感受
about what I was feeling?

349
00:13:04,580 --> 00:13:07,240
我去万圣节商店买了瓶假血
Okay, I got a bottle of fake blood out of the Halloween supplies.

350
00:13:07,711 --> 00:13:10,040
在手指上抹一点 说你割到指头了
Put a dab on your finger, say you cut it.

351
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,800
然后我说得带你去看医生 轻松当飞人
I say I need to run you by the doctor. Easy trapezy.

352
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,040
知道了不
Got it?

353
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,680
咱飞人天堂见 哥们
See ya on the other side, brother.

354
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:19,280
一次也好 我希望菲尔能表示一下同情
Just once, I would like Phil to have a little empathy,

355
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:23,600
向我表达一下他理解女性的痛苦
give me some sense that he understands what women go through.

356
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,140
你们感觉好点儿了没
You feeling any better?

357
00:13:25,205 --> 00:13:28,220
真不愿看见我家姑娘们都这么窝着
Hate to see the whole team on the D.L.

358
00:13:28,220 --> 00:13:29,040
我的手指头
Ow! My finger!

359
00:13:29,380 --> 00:13:31,420
听起来不妙啊
I don't like the sound of that.

360
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:36,340
我说的是一点儿
I said a little bit!

361
00:13:36,340 --> 00:13:38,860
盖子掉了 然后我决定将计就计
The cap fell off. I decided to just go with it.

362
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:39,960
好吧 得先把你弄出去
Okay, we gotta get you out the back.

363
00:13:40,981 --> 00:13:43,880
-天啊 这是怎么了 -就一个小伤口
- God, what happened?! - Oh, it's just a little cut.

364
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,520
不过保险起见 我得带他去看看医生
But to be safe, I'll run him by the doctor.

365
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,870
你疯了吗 得打急救电话
No, are you crazy?! Call 9-1-1!

366
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:49,140
不不 他们忙着呢
No, no, they're so busy.

367
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:51,080
伤口在哪 我们得按住伤口吧
Where's the wound?! We need to put pressure on it, right?

368
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,322
-我要吐了 -在指头上
- I'm gonna be sick! - My--my finger.

369
00:13:52,322 --> 00:13:54,302
得给他上止血带 该往哪绑
Oh, he needs a tourniquet! Where do I put it?!

370
00:13:54,302 --> 00:13:56,828
-我指头上 -住手 他什么事都没有
- On my finger. - Stop! There is nothing wrong with him.

371
00:13:57,060 --> 00:13:59,060
-卢克 这是怎么回事 -我割到手指了
- Luke, what's going on? - I cut my finger?

372
00:14:00,260 --> 00:14:01,580
-老爸 -多神呐
- Dad? - How crazy is that?

373
00:14:01,660 --> 00:14:03,440
原来眼镜一直在我兜里 待会见
They were in my pocket the whole time. I'll see you.

374
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:04,060
菲尔
Phil!

375
00:14:05,020 --> 00:14:06,180
到底是怎么回事 卢克
What is going on, Luke?

376
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:07,392
这一切都是老爸导演的
Dad staged the whole thing

377
00:14:07,392 --> 00:14:09,733
好让我们去玩飞人 不带你们仨
so we could go on the trapeze without you three.

378
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:10,300
为什么
Why?

379
00:14:11,900 --> 00:14:12,300
因为
Because...

380
00:14:12,504 --> 00:14:13,764
因为
B-because...

381
00:14:14,094 --> 00:14:16,789
就因为这个 你们都跟魔鬼一样
Because of this! You're all monster-ating!

382
00:14:16,789 --> 00:14:19,300
-卢克别 -开什么玩笑 神啊
- Luke, no! - Are you kidding me?!Oh, my god! Oh, my lord.

383
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:21,740
抱歉 我知道你说过要严守党的机密 可我
Sorry! I know you told me not to say it, but I...

384
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:22,220
菲尔
Phil!

385
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:24,320
你就是这样教儿子的吗
Is this what you've been teaching our son?

386
00:14:24,386 --> 00:14:26,920
女人都是不干净的麻风病人
That--that women are some kind of unclean lepers

387
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:29,380
得在床单下隔离一周吗
that should be hidden away under sheets for a week?

388
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:31,220
你知道这样有多冒犯吗
Do you have any idea how offensive that it?

389
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:32,700
我知道 亲爱的
I do, honey.

390
00:14:32,700 --> 00:14:34,680
我从内心深处表示
And from the bottom of my heart,

391
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,620
我感到非常
I am so...

392
00:14:36,719 --> 00:14:38,619
害怕
s-s-scared.

393
00:14:39,232 --> 00:14:40,249
不是吧
Ugh! Oh, no!

394
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:42,340
老天
Oh, my.

395
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:48,960
好了
Okay.

396
00:14:51,374 --> 00:14:53,020
惊喜
Surprise!

397
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:55,020
我的天 太不可思议了
Oh, my gosh! Oh, it's amazing!

398
00:14:55,031 --> 00:14:56,980
-是船上派对 -用意何在
- Yeah, it's a boat party. - Oh! Because?

399
00:14:56,980 --> 00:14:58,460
你的人生就像一次远航
Your life is like a voyage.

400
00:14:58,460 --> 00:15:00,809
每个人不都是吗 不过我喜欢这个
Oh! Well, everyone's is, but I love it

401
00:15:00,820 --> 00:15:02,480
我们的朋友都没玩过这个
because none of our other friends have ever done it.

402
00:15:03,562 --> 00:15:05,760
太贴心了
Aw. That's so sweet.

403
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:09,220
感情关系里没有肮脏崩溃的女人一定很爽吧
Oh, it must be easy with no dirty, broken woman in the relationship.

404
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,180
你笑什么笑
What are you laughing at?

405
00:15:13,540 --> 00:15:16,080
大家跟着生日旗帜走
Okay, everybody follow the birthday flag!

406
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:18,074
你叫我什么 哦对
What'd you call me? Oh. Uh, oh, yes.

407
00:15:18,074 --> 00:15:21,040
我的天 太优雅了 胡娇肯定嫉妒死了
Oh, my gosh. It's so elegant. I'll bet Pepper is dying.

408
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,640
那个 实际上 胡娇没来
Oh, you know, actually, Pepper couldn't come.

409
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:24,800
因为他讨厌船 参加过海军的人 你懂的
Because he hates boats. You know, after the navy.

410
00:15:25,380 --> 00:15:26,140
对 对
Yeah. Oh, yeah.

411
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:29,170
我猜朗吉纳斯已经战胜了怕水的问题吧
I guess Longinus got over his fear of--of water?

412
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:29,720
不 不
Mnh. No, no.

413
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,720
我们还是把注意力放在到场的30人吧
Why don't we just focus on the 30 people who are here,

414
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:32,860
好好玩
having a great time!

415
00:15:33,153 --> 00:15:36,329
恶 闻着有股死人味道
Ew! It smells like somebody's dead.

416
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:37,520
那是什么味道
Ugh! What is that smell?

417
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:40,840
那淡淡的味道来自于 一只小小的蓝鲸
That faint odor is-- is a tiny, tiny blue whale

418
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:43,440
倒确实是死在附近的
who apparently has indeed died, uh, nearby.

419
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,080
不过呢
But...

420
00:15:44,199 --> 00:15:46,960
搞的我外套上全是这个味
Si, but it's getting all over my coat.

421
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:47,880
我什么也闻不到
I don't smell anything.

422
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,700
大概是因为你闻起来像是一捧花
Maybe that's because you smell like a bouquet of flowers.

423
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:53,420
对了 小心脚下
Oh, yeah. Watch out for that.

424
00:15:53,420 --> 00:15:56,080
这味道好像是呕吐物跟大便结婚
Ugh! It smells like puke married poop

425
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,160
然后在我鼻子里举行婚礼
and had the ceremony in my nose.

426
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,500
画面感太强了
You paint with words.

427
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,040
好 大家别着急
Okay, don't worry, everybody.

428
00:16:01,050 --> 00:16:04,226
马上我们就会远在海上 乘风逐浪
Soon we'll be way, way out at sea, bouncing on the waves

429
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:06,520
闻到的都是蓝鲸兄弟姐妹们的甜甜香气
with all of his sweet-smelling brothers and sisters. Okay?

430
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:08,040
-米奇尔·普里契特 -是的 你好
- Mitchell Pritchett? - Oh, yes. Hi.

431
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:10,080
你好 我是今晚的船长 我们遇到点问题
Hi. I'm your captain tonight. We've got a problem.

432
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:11,560
我没办法让这么多人上船
I can't fit this many people on my boat.

433
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:13,480
不要吧 之前告诉我能载30人的
No, no. I was--I was told you could take 30.

434
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,700
我刚好有30名客人
I have exactly 30 guests.

435
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:16,813
我有6名船员 你得留下几个人
Plus six in help. You gotta drop a few people.

436
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:19,420
拜托 一定有点什么办法的
Come on. There--there must be something that we can do here.

437
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,640
我们有大点的船
Well, we have bigger boats,

438
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,720
不过提前两个小时订 就只有这个了
But this is the best I could do on two hours' notice.

439
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,540
有什么问题吗
What is the problem?

440
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:25,420
很明显呢
Apparently,

441
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:27,560
米奇尔两小时前才开始筹划我的生日派对
Mitchell started planning my birthday party two hours ago.

442
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:29,720
不不 不是的
Mnh-mnh. No. No, I-I did not.

443
00:16:29,771 --> 00:16:32,540
显然 我们人太多不能上船
Uh, apparently, we have too many people for his boat.

444
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:34,120
-所以 -太扯了吧
- So... - That's crazy.

445
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:36,960
我见过抓在一块门板上漂的人比这都多[偷渡]
I've seen more people clinging to a floating door.

446
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:38,780
抱歉女士 这涉及到安全问题
I'm sorry, lady. It's a safety issue.

447
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:40,820
不 你如果不把我们从这臭鲸旁送走
Oh, no. You're going to have a safety issue

448
00:16:40,820 --> 00:16:43,280
你就会有安全问题
if you don't take me away from this whale.

449
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:45,280
不要指指点点 态度也不要这么恶劣
Okay, little too much finger, little too much attitude.

450
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:45,940
这是怎么了
What's all this?

451
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:48,540
米奇尔辛苦了两小时的成果就要化为乌有了
Uh, two hours of Mitchell's hard work going down the drain.

452
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:51,900
这船不能承载超过30个人
Look, I can't fit more than 30 people on the boat,

453
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,580
我在跟这位女士解释
As I was just explaining to the lady here.

454
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:55,280
注意了 你说的"女士"可是我的儿子
Well, first of all, that "Lady" is my son.

455
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:57,060
他说的不是我
He wasn't talking about me.

456
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:58,380
我说的是她
I was talking about her.

457
00:16:58,380 --> 00:17:00,000
她 又变成"她"了
Oh. Her. Oh, it's "Her" now.

458
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,000
而她是我的老婆
Well, "Her" happens to be my wife.

459
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,580
你跟她过不去 就是跟我过不去
You got a problem with her, you got a problem with me.

460
00:17:04,758 --> 00:17:06,300
别这样 杰
No, no, Jay...

461
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:08,040
-冷静 -我之前没跟谁过不去
- Calm down. - I didn't have a problem before,

462
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:08,880
现在老子就是要为难一下你们
but now I'm starting to.

463
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:11,020
跟老子过不去你他妈的绝对没好下场
No, your problem's about to get a lot bigger.

464
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:13,660
杰 你以为这是我想要的 其实不是
No, Jay, I know you think this is what I want, but it's not.

465
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:15,460
-交给我处理 歌洛莉亚 -别这样 杰
- I've got this, Gloria. - No, Jay.

466
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:18,840
今天是我犯傻了 我喜欢你那么冷静
I was just being stupid today. I like that you're calm,

467
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,020
你总是三思而后行
that you think first, and you act second.

468
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,860
我的生活需要这样的你
I need that in my life.

469
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:24,620
闪边去吧 爷爷
Yeah, so walk away, grandpa.

470
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:25,300
说什么呢
You know what?

471
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:27,900
谁都不能叫他"爷爷"
Nobody call him "Grandpa"!

472
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:29,100
我叫啊
I do.

473
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,020
行了 够了
Okay, that's it!

474
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:34,320
不许上船 所有人滚下去 否则我报警
No boat! Everybody off my dock, or I'm calling the cops!

475
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:35,660
现在连派对都没了吗
So no party now?

476
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,600
不是 当然有 拜托...
No! No, of course! Just...

477
00:17:37,631 --> 00:17:38,740
拜托给我一分钟好吗
Just... Just give me a minute okay?

478
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:40,200
两小时做的都不过如此
Oh, after what you did with two hours,

479
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:42,600
-真等不及看你一分钟的成果 -小卡
- I can't wait to see what you do with a minute. - Cam!

480
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,560
可怜的小卡 他好生气啊
Poor Cam. He seems so upset.

481
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:47,280
你觉得难受吗 菲尔
Oh, is that hard for you, Phil,

482
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:49,066
就因为有情绪的人出现在你身边
That he's have a feeling around you?

483
00:17:49,066 --> 00:17:50,989
-好抱歉哦 -好情绪化哦
- I'm so sorry. - Too many emotions?

484
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,420
好了 好了 我认输了
Okay, okay, I give up!

485
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:55,940
是的 今天我错了
Yeah, I made a mistake today.

486
00:17:55,940 --> 00:17:58,200
那也是因为你们三个联合起来对付我
But only because the three of you ganged up on me

487
00:17:58,200 --> 00:18:00,360
就好像狼人 吸血鬼 科学怪人
like when the wolfman, Dracula, and Frankenstein

488
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,800
扎堆在一部电影里
show up in the same movie,

489
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,360
但绝不是以很酷的方式扎堆
except this wasn't awesome!

490
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:07,040
我今天的情绪就跟翻江倒海似的
I have been on an emotional roller coaster all day today.

491
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:09,680
我害怕 我生气 我生气因为我害怕
I'm afraid. I'm mad. I'm mad because I'm afraid,

492
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:10,620
现在我脑袋都成浆糊了
and now I can't even think straight

493
00:18:10,620 --> 00:18:12,840
因为刚刚绊的那一下让我好痛
because I'm in so much pain from what just happened over there!

494
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:15,540
这一切让我好伤心 我却不知道为什么
And the whole thing makes me so sad, and I'm not even sure why,

495
00:18:15,540 --> 00:18:17,940
这臭味令我恶心 但是我却好饿
and I'm nauseous from that smell but I'm so hungry.

496
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:22,500
没事的
Yeah.

497
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:27,460
小卡 我最初根本不是想办游船派对
Cam, the--the boat wasn't even part of the plan.

498
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:28,420
没关系
No, it's fine.

499
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:31,000
期望太高是我的错
It's my fault for letting my expectations get too high.

500
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:32,840
-这次我也不会计较的 -不不
- I'll get over this one, too. - No, no.

501
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:35,300
其实我早就计划好了"绿野仙踪"主题派对
I had this whole "Wizard of OZ" party planned,

502
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:37,280
只不过我今天才意识到可能
only today I realized that it might be

503
00:18:37,291 --> 00:18:39,378
太过"龙卷风"风格了
a-a little too tornado-y.

504
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,120
-今天 -是的
- Today? - Yes!

505
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:42,255
抱歉我之前没想到这点
I'm sorry I-I didn't make the connection, okay?

506
00:18:42,255 --> 00:18:44,360
可能是因为我精心计划了几个月
Probably 'cause I've been planning for months

507
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:46,680
力图使你可以拥有完美的派对 可以开心
so that you could have the perfect party and be happy,

508
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,830
而现在我觉得根本没可能了
which now I don't even think is possible.

509
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:50,480
我想拥有一个美好的
Oh, I'm sorry that I would like to have

510
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:52,280
10岁生日派对是我的错
a nice 10th birthday party.

511
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,980
你不可能拥有 小卡
Well, you can't have it, Cam!

512
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:56,298
想知道原因吗 因为你40岁了
You wanna know why?! Because you're 40!

513
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:58,540
你是个40岁的大男人
You're a 40-year-old man!

514
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:02,840
我40了
I am 40.

515
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:07,860
-我40了 -没错
- I'm 40. - Yes.

516
00:19:10,459 --> 00:19:11,927
小卡 别这样
Oh, Cam, stop it.

517
00:19:11,927 --> 00:19:15,360
我40了 而我却坐在这破...这什么东西
I'm 40 and I'm--I'm on this stupid--wait, what is that?!

518
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:16,549
这个
Oh, it's this...

519
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:17,540
破玩意儿
thing!

520
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,880
一下子 我开窍了
Suddenly, it all made sense.

521
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:23,000
小卡整天的抓狂表现不是因为派对
Cam's craziness all day wasn't about a party.

522
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:24,600
而是因为他40岁了
it was about turning 40.

523
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:28,400
一旦他意识到这点 情况变得更糟糕
And once he realized that, everything got much worse.

524
00:19:28,556 --> 00:19:31,404
-我根本一事无成 -别这样
- I've done nothing with my life! - Oh, w--stop it.

525
00:19:31,404 --> 00:19:33,119
别这样 怎么能这样说呢
Come on. How--how can you say that?

526
00:19:33,119 --> 00:19:36,101
你是个好父亲 你...
You're--you're a wonderful father. You...

527
00:19:36,101 --> 00:19:38,440
你从小丑大学毕业了
You--you graduated from clown college.

528
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:39,660
你去过法国
You've been to France.

529
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,120
我不想要40岁啦 好不公平
I don't want to be 40. It's not fair!

530
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:44,416
-我了解 -世上本就没公平可言
- I know. - Nothing's fair.

531
00:19:45,237 --> 00:19:46,790
两英里外就是个游乐园
2 miles from here is an amusement park

532
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:49,382
挤满了玩"空中飞人"的欢乐家庭
full of happy families swgiging on a trapeze.

533
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:52,900
四年才多出的一天 我只有这个小小要求
That's all I wanted for my special bonus day.

534
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:57,440
什么
What?

535
00:19:57,578 --> 00:19:59,440
我绞尽脑汁
I'd been trying so hard

536
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,340
想琢磨出小卡生日到底想要什么
to figure out what Cam wanted for his birthday.

537
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:04,580
其实他一直都在告诉我
He'd been telling me all along.

538
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:06,420
他只想要10岁
He wanted to be 10.

539
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,480
真的吗 你没有办法吗
Seriously? There's nothing you can do?

540
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,320
抱歉 到结束时间了
I'm sorry. You just missed the cutoff.

541
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:22,800
不如下次再来玩吧
How about we see you next time?

542
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:26,980
不如你破个例 让他上去飞飞
How about you make an exception and strap him in there?

543
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:29,111
是啊 我们不就迟了10分钟嘛
Yeah, we're, like,ten minutes past your deadline, anyway.

544
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:30,900
你今天最好别惹我们
And you don't want to make us angry today.

545
00:20:30,900 --> 00:20:32,584
-女士们 没法破例 -女士们
- Ladies, uh, I really can't make any exceptions. - "Ladies"?

546
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:41,360
这就是她们向我道歉的方式
And that was how they apologized to me.

547
00:20:41,364 --> 00:20:42,352
加油 菲尔
Come on, Phil!

548
00:20:42,793 --> 00:20:43,613
天啊 菲尔
Oh, god, Phil!

549
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:48,620
你成功了
You did it!

550
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:52,280
我想应该是道歉吧 我不好意思开口问
At least, I-I think it was. I could never ask them.

551
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:58,060
感觉太爽了
This is so satisfying!

552
00:20:58,060 --> 00:20:59,655
今天就这时候感觉最爽
Best I've felt all day!

553
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:04,740
我可以每月租一次这个吗
Can I rent one of these on a monthly basis?

554
00:21:06,069 --> 00:21:08,057
太棒了
Yes!

555
00:21:08,067 --> 00:21:09,873
好耶
Oh, yay!

556
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:13,080
最开心的40岁生日派对
Best 40th birthday party ever.

557
00:21:13,080 --> 00:21:15,450
不不 10岁
No, no. 10th.

558
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,980
-可以吗 -可以
- Really? - Yeah.

559
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:19,040
事实上 你还是那个我爱上的
In fact, you're still that sexy little 8 year old

560
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:20,160
性感8岁小男孩
I fell in love with.

561
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:24,860
算了 走吧
No, just go.
